304 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 257 0 R/E(tracking application that records match-wise player information in an organized way. The application will contain custom objects such as Player and Match Performance, with suitable fields and relationships. It will help us store statistics, view player performance, prepare reports, and understand how Salesforce can be used to build a practical sports-management application.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

