545 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 262 0 R/T(details and match performance can become scattered when they are kept in separate documents. CRICKSTATS provides a common Salesforce environment where these records can be created and connected. Match statistics can be summarized at the player level, while reports and dashboards make the information easier to review. The project therefore combines structured data storage, relationships, automation, and analytics to create a practical performance tracking workflow.)/E(details and match performance can become scattered when they are kept in separate documents. CRICKSTATS provides a common Salesforce environment where these records can be created and connected. Match statistics can be summarized at the player level, while reports and dashboards make the information easier to review. The project therefore combines structured data storage, relationships, automation, and analytics to create a practical performance tracking workflow.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[38]>>
