<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 287 0 R/T(In addition, system performance was evaluated by monitoring response time during data entry, report generation, and dashboard loading. The application was tested under multiple user interactions to ensure stable performance without delays. Screenshots of generated reports and interactive dashboards were documented to confirm accurate data visualization, real-time updates, and reliable performance tracking. These testing )/E(In addition, system performance was evaluated by monitoring response time during data entry, report generation, and dashboard loading. The application was tested under multiple user interactions to ensure stable performance without delays. Screenshots of generated reports and interactive dashboards were documented to confirm accurate data visualization, real-time updates, and reliable performance tracking. These testing )/Pg 40 0 R/K[9]>>
