1858 0 obj
<</Title(CRICKSTATS is a Salesforce application developed as an academic project for recording and reviewing cricket player performance. Instead of maintaining player statistics in separate files, the project brings player details and match performance into one structured system. The application uses Salesforce objects, fields, relationships, flows, reports, and dashboards. It is designed to make entering match statistics easier and to provide a clear view of player performance for coaches, managers, analysts, and students working with the system.)/Dest[10 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1663 0 R>>
endobj

